\"20\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,28,18)\">Prov 28:18</ref> read probably with <bdbheb>ᵑ6</bdbheb> Lag Dy Bi <bdbheb>בַּשָּׁ֑חַת</bdbheb>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:28\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,28)\">Judg 16:28</ref> is rather 'vengeance for <highlight>one</highlight> of my two eyes' (see GFM). <ref ref=\"Jer 10:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,8)\">Jer 10:8</ref> <bdbheb>בְּאַחַת</bdbheb> probably = <highlight>in one, altogether</highlight>. <bdbheb>אחד</bdbheb>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> <highlight>one . . . another, the one . . . the other</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>֗֗֗ א</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 17:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,12)\">Exod 17:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 18:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,3)\">Exod 18:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 18:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,4)\">Exod 18:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 4:7\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,7)\">Amos 4:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:1\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,1)\">2Sam 12:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 24:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,24,2)\">Jer 24:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 3:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,3,17)\">2Chr 3:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 4:11\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,11)\">Neh 4:11</ref> +; <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,6)\">2Sam 14:6</ref> read <bdbheb>הָאֶחָד אֶתאָֿחִיו</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>האחד אתהֿאחד</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Se